# Flight release → Firebase (`firebaseMin`)

**Locked 18 Sep 2026** (proven extra **6850** / PFR `933-091826-17`). Detail: `docs/flight-release-firebase.md`.

## Write

- **Only** `flights/{pfr._id}/release/releaseStatus` `{ merge: true }`.
- Signatures **set on this save** + JS `Date` timestamps. **Omit** unset names (never `pilotAgree: null` on dispatch-only).
- **Wipe (explicit `null` on all three names + timestamps)** only when **Remove Release** cleared the flight (web admin button or mobile remove-release).

## Do not

- Merge release fields onto the **parent** PFR (Flight Report / Ryan).
- Compact vs copy-all experiments, ISO-string timestamps, or `matchLivePfr` inside `firebaseMin`.
- “Fix” iPad display by changing this payload. If FR wipes or ignores `releaseStatus`, that is **not** an FRA `firebaseMin` change unless Andy asks.

Web PATCH and mobile sign/remove must keep using `runFlightUpdateSideEffects` → `firebaseMin`.
